OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some patchy rain at first.
OL,7,FMore persistent and occasionally heavy
OL,8,Frain will spread north later in the
OL,9,Fevening and overnight, heavy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,12,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,13,Fnorth in the morning. Further showery
OL,14,Frain in the afternoon, occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
