OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FUnsettled on Wednesday with showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,8,FRain clears Thursday morning, then
OL,9,Fdrier and brighter. Showery rain from
OL,10,Fthe west on Friday.
